/**
 * Display codes of the drivers (C-01, K-13, ...): the driver each one names
 * and its force.
 *
 * Generated by scripts/generate_seed.py from data/drivers/driver_base.json;
 * do not edit. A code is the force letter (C Consumer, K Customer, T
 * Technology, G Government, E Environmental, X Competitive) and the number
 * of the driver id: 'C-01' is consumer_r01. The Consumer Journey content
 * cites drivers by these codes. The map carries no name, direction or
 * text: those come from the drivers the dashboard loads from the API,
 * which answers a signed-in user with a role and nobody else.
 */

